- Request a defined training scope for aged-care, healthcare or support teams.

#### Certificate / course mixed intent — gated Search-only brief

This RSA set serves Appendix B `GOOGLE_CONV_Certificate-MixedIntent_AU_2026Q3` and the approximately 3,400-searches-per-month certificate/course pool. Buyer type is **UNCLASSIFIED**. Use Exact and Phrase only, qualify the organisational need in ad copy, and route to the gated certificate LP block. **Do not build or publish until ErgoWorks confirms whether it issues an accredited certificate, statement of attainment, or participant attendance/training-completion records and signs off the corresponding claims.** Exclude this theme from Meta.

